hero in a voice booth\",\"uploadDate\":\"2021-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Big American Super Hero Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Is it a bird or a plane? No... it's Guy Harris</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Are you looking for a Hero?</h2>\r\n<p>I've had many nice emails over the years and some have called me a hero for saving the day with how fast I turn audio around and get it back to clients. So let me put on my outfit and be ready to Kapow you with a great delivery and in a super quick time.<br>And thats exactly it, everyone needs things yesterday these days, so let me help. I'll send back a broadcast quality wav file the same day. \r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/assets/audio/super-hero-voice-guy-harris.mp3","title":"Big American Super Hero Voice"}]}],false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/big-super-hero-voiceover.jpg","alt":"big-super-hero-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Let me save the day!</h2>\r\n<p>I have plenty of <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voices\">Character Voices</a> to choose from, but I must admit when a script arrives with 'Super Hero Voice', I do smile. <br>Is it a radio ad? A web promo? Part of a tv commercial? Something fun for a friend? I'm standing by ready to voice from my <a href=\"/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Super Hero Headquarters\">Super Hero Headquarters</a>.<br>\r\nTrusted by the worlds biggest brands, let me be the guardian and be the protector of your epic project!\r\n</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>No Spandex! Just the Voice!</h2>\r\n<p>Let me work with you on your project. If it's the super hero voice that you need then either pickup the red phone or simply drop me an email. Do let me know what you are doing with it? How its being used and all that. That way I can better quote you. I'm more than happy to send you a short sample to help you hear it in context or to send to your end client too. Fill in the form here or visit my <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\" >contact page </a> and tell me more. I hope I can save the day!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L5",null,{"pageTitle":"Big American Super Hero Voice","pageUrl":"big-super-hero-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L4","678",{"href":"/betfred-football-commentator","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/betfred-football-commentator.jpg","alt":"Betfred football commentator voiceover Guy Harris","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Betfred Football Commentator"}]]}],["$","$L4","887",{"href":"/psycho-circus-scary-evil-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/psycho-circus-scary-voice.jpg","alt":"psycho